\v 14 I was¦125784 progressing¦125784 in Judaism¦125787\x + \xo 1:14: \xt Acts 22:3.\x* quicker than many¦125789 of¦125794 my¦125794 contemporaries¦125790, being¦125798 so much more¦125795 zealous¦125797 in observing our ancient traditions¦125802.
